1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,400
Finally! Three centuries waiting for visitors.

2
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:11,600
Listen up, you miserable lot... we crashed. And a witch found us.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,600
Plan A: take off.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,600
Plan B: blame Galleta.

5
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:24,000
Without its three bells, that sleigh won't fly.

6
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:26,200
They fell into the Valley of October.

7
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:30,100
A valley… full of monsters.

8
00:00:30,430 --> 00:00:33,130
MONSTERS?! I'm not scared.

9
00:00:33,330 --> 00:00:35,130
I'm assessing the situation.

10
00:00:35,330 --> 00:00:40,030
Galleta found the way. It was luck. I had it all figured out.

11
00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:43,930
What monster do you think is waiting for us? I'm reading your comments.
